Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,voices we take In the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go Get the sails all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah Here we are\Nin between the sea and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky Ready now for adventure We're itching\Nto try Get ready to roam So all aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,now we're set to go Set sail to the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so deep Ready for a truly grand adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think that sounds really\Nfun All this excitement is second to none
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,voices we take In the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that I just won't ever\Nforget It's the way that I felt when our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,journey was set Now I won't be scared As
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.64,0:01:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,\Ncause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.22,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.12,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough ghosts for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.74,0:02:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a whole island of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What about that ghost we saw before, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it still here on the boat? No,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,looked like it was\Nflying to the island I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,guessing that's where the\Nthing came from Interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Brooke said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the lab noise we heard earlier Was\Nfrom that gate over there closing shut
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not that we ran into it\NBut that we were eaten by the mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It ate us. The fog makes it\Ndifficult to tell, but I imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that the walls we see here\Nextend all the way around the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,island in a circle that means\Nthat we were intentionally
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,pulled in and now that the gate\Nis closed we're trapped inside
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,i see that's why the skeleton\Ntold us to run away it's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,because we're stuck inside some\Nkind of trap wait then that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,would mean the people here are\Ncapturing sailors on purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,right but why if this is a\Nmoving island that means we're
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,still technically out at sea\Nguess it won't be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,anchor down here hold on that's\Nthe last thing we want to do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we gotta get out of this place\Nright now bad news you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,i think i have i can't go on\Nthat island sickness me too i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,real sick no problem you two\Nwatch the ship and you've got
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,stupid adventure sickness again\Ncome to your senses come on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,look at that that creepy\Nlooking building is a Bone Fight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,haunted mansion if i've ever seen\None and i'm not talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the fun kind either the kind\Nwill you never make it out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,alive you worry too much i'm\Nnot going there to pick a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,i promise i'll be careful i\Njust want to catch that ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep it as a pet you're\Ngonna get us all killed either
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,way brook's a part of our crew\Nnow so i have to bring him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,back saji give me pirate lunchbox\Nhe's a part of our crew hey
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,i did not vote for that if we\Nhave a living skeleton wandering
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,around the ship i won't be\Nable to sleep at night here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,i've got the lunch boxes\Nluffy Franky it's up to you to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,take care of robin while i watch\Nthe boat nothing gets my cola
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,pumping like an adventure on\Na crazy new island robin you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't seriously going with them\Nare you it does sound exciting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,right now listen up obviously\Nwe're going to use a smaller
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,boat to pull us close to the\Nshore and the soldier dock
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,system has something pretty\Ndamn super for that i've been
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,keeping this one a surprise it's\Nchannel two what's that good
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The system has six channels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of them are zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's one, two, three, and four.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, each dock has\Nits own set of capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We know the zeros are for paddling, and\Nwe've already seen one and three, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you tell us a while back that docks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,two and four were empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just told you that so I\Ncould surprise you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier dock system\Nchannel 2, launch! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A battleship shopping boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it Mini Mary 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Mary's been reborn as a landing crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She may be tiny, but I'm\Nhappy to ride her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is one surprise that\Nwas definitely worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Franky. I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With a ship like that, I can go shopping\Nfor food in style anytime I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and let me ride it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and let me ride it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, that was\Npretty thoughtful of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your horses, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have our chance to take\Nher for a ride soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, how about we let\Nthose three have a little fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So is that all the doc\Nstuff, or what? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Including Channel 1 and 3 that I showed\Nyou before, now you've seen it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Channel 0, support paddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Channel 1, a single-seat\Nwaver, the white hobby horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Channel 3, a triple-seater scouting\Nsubmarine, the shark-submerged 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, Channel 2, a four-person\Nshopping boat, the mini-Mary 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, at least, those are all the\Nfeatures of the ship's soldier dock system.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think of the\NSunny as our mothership?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then these guys are all\Nthe little soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,that help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a genius, Franky!\NKeep it up! Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good, good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm extra awesome this week, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:06:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not in trouble, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm can't see a damn thing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just fog and more fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounded like it came from the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.84,0:07:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta come back so I\Ncan ride the mini Mary, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.28,0:07:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all you're worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.78,0:07:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Nami chopper\Na new supper out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Too, you know, just saying.\NI wonder, perhaps they.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,fell victim to a curse\Nfrom that ghost come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not funny
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that? Crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The anchor just dropped on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just built it, so there's no\Nway that the gears got loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, pull it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have the ship\Nlose its balance now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Did somebody touch the hatch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now is not the time for this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you take things seriously for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'm not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just moved on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is strange. I got a\Nhunch we're not alone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's an enemy on this ship so\Nyou think it's a ghost doing this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it someone with\Na Devil Fruit power who
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,or whatever it is at least\Nwe know they're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now I heard what sounded like\Nsome sort of beast growling a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more concerned about Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys take care of the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna swim over to the\Nisland and rescue her of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, uh, having problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw what happened to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it wants\Nto keep us on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't see this bastard at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It could take us out one by one, and\Nwe couldn't do a damn thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is grabbing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard, get your\Ninvisible hands off her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It really does sound\Nlike some kind of animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know what's going on,\Nbut we got waves inside the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pushing us away from the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you. You okay? I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, raise the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can do it without\Nfalling on your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I'm not throwing swords!\NUsopp! Chopper! Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get separated from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta have some kind of secret\Nweapon for a time like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bust out the surprise hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.45,0:10:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That wall must be six\Nor seven meters high.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky we're still okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that ghost island, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So not like you're surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already been over this, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we were up there,\Nhow did we get down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We got excited about the Mini Mary, and\Nbefore we knew it, we hit the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't notice it, but the wall\Nup there is the edge of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When we ran into it, we were\Nall thrown off the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we landed in this moat here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I admit that was 100 % my fault, but\NI'm cute, so you'll forgive me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right after I smack you! Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,what I don't get is why\Nthey have a moat on the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,other side of the wall\Nright at the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things,\Nit's some kind of trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think of it that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we're lucky we didn't fall on\Nany spears or giant spikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing we had all these\Nskeletons here to cushion our fall, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop that already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.92,0:11:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, but we're still\Nnear the entrance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stay put for a while,\NLuffy will come and find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He might try, but we're below sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that put us in a bad spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, then\Nthey might not notice us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We should find a way out of this\Npit and wait for them by the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so, but which way should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It all looks bad
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that thing a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no dog. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.18,0:12:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Cerberus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Cerberus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the heck's a\NCerberus? You don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the guardian of the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, there's no way that's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at it, you got a better explanation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So did we die and go\Nto the underworld? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stop and lead us, keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you notice something, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? A bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,One of your heads is a\Nbuck's head, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I liked it better when it was yelping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,See, it is sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I see stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can get up to the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For a dog, it's sense\Nof smell sure is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It chased us all the way\Ninto this creepy forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster is still\Nroaming around down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we climb to the ground and wait\Nfor help, it could find us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the quandary, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon my manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Hildon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and speaking of bad manners,\NI was spying on all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That dog really seemed to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The night has just begun, but already\Nthe shadows in the forest are deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:14:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it shall be transformed into a world
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,of terror far beyond\Nyour worst nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I recommend you\Ntake a ride with me in my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,carriage we could go to the\Nmansion together mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkback's abode is just out the way.\NHuh? What do you know? I'm Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,hey
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,i
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.19,0:15:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,get a good look at them so
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.11,0:15:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe it's my imagination\NBut don't those horses seem a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,bit strange it's dark your\Neyes are playing tricks on you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well if you say so i'm sure it's fine anyway\Nthanks for saving us back there We were
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,in bad shape before you showed up it was\Nnothing have a drink to calm your nerves
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this forest is filled with frightening
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,creatures it's dangerous\Nto pass through on foot
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised i thought\Ncerberus was just a legend
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but there it was three heads\Ngnashing and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing must have\Nbeen some kind of mutant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It just wasn't natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We were lucky we got up in that tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was afraid I'd never come\Ndown again with that thing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're hoping to wait for your\Nfriends, the mansion's the safest place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, they couldn't possibly miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, we're gonna get to meet Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hog back too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.12,0:16:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Hog guy really that famous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every doctor in the world knows his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the greatest surgeons ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He can perform real miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They say his operations have saved\Nmore people than there are Stars in the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.28,0:16:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,sky he has fame and fortune and every\Nother honor a doctor could ever hope for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire medical community\Nlooks up to him as a true hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But then he just\Ndisappeared without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:17:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people thought he had an accident\Nand others thought that he was kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end since no one could find\Nany clues everyone gave up looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,him and bit by bit we started thinking\Nof him as nothing more than a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the hot fact you're\Ntalking about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's studying in seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor came to this island to conduct\Nresearch beyond the scope of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.76,0:17:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I could get\Nan autograph from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he could be persuaded to\Nspare a moment for one of his fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This island has lions, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a lion but he...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His face was it looked like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to see then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.36,0:18:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.28,0:18:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That is definitely not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to turn around, Hildon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness, whatever could\Nhave upset you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you all saw an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There was definitely\Nsomething out there for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This forest is freaking strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That much is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a bit odd here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The fog, for example,\Nhas strange qualities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It can even cause hallucinations for some.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So you mean it was just the fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Illusion? The fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Hildon, I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but we really do need you to take\Nus back to the coast right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's dangerous, the\Nthree of us can manage somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to meet Dr. Hog back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but my something freaky is going\Non here, Censor, is on high alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to trust my powers on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Either you can go see the doctor and\Ndie, or we can turn back now and live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, as you wish, I'll have the driver\Nturn the carriage around for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.94,0:19:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment and I shall return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Chopper, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what this means to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:19:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was strong and brave like Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I could just walk there by myself\Ninstead of sitting here and crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How long does he plan\Nto make us wait here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know, but I'm too\Nscared to look outside again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just turning around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It should only take a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, they left us in the\Nmiddle of some scary graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me? But why? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, someone tell me\Nyou just left it go feed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.12,0:20:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving us alone at night is one\Nthing, but come on in a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.32,0:21:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a dream, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It bit me! Aw, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn into a zombie now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.83,0:22:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.72,0:22:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Usopp go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.82,0:22:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:22:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There you dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.72,0:22:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them bite me! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I said get off me! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The exploding star should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.56,0:23:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombies hate fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.30,0:23:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No fire! Get back, man! That'll burn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.40,0:23:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured it would work,\Nbut I wasn't expecting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't your perish race, you warts?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.16,0:23:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You little turd!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.70,0:23:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that got the\Nzombies out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.78,0:23:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we might as well make a run for the\Nmansion since it's closer than the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.76,0:23:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a good idea to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.60,0:23:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.76,0:23:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.48,0:23:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we're able to keep up the pace,\Nthere's no way those things can catch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they're strong\Nand don't get tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,they shamble along really\Nslow when they move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.20,0:23:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.11,0:23:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Were they just lazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:23:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.78,0:24:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.98,0:24:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're tired now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.48,0:24:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't following us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.46,0:24:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what is with this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.42,0:24:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Half the stuff here isn't\Neven supposed to be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.84,0:24:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,if I start turning into a zombie and go\Nafter your brains, they'd just kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.90,0:24:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get bit by a zombie, you\Nturn into one and eat brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.70,0:24:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I read it in a book, so it must be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.28,0:24:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're mature\Nenough for horror novels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.34,0:24:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You should stick to children's books.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.40,0:24:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure could go for a glass of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, I can see him after all. Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's crazy enough to live here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.28,0:24:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling he's not going to\Nbe quite as welcoming as you hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.48,0:24:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:24:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the mansion of Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.12,0:25:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback by any chance?
